  m_text: The game covers various aspects related to construction workers, including
    specializations, safety measures, materials, waste disposal, and the importance
    of following manufacturers instructions. The goal is to reinforce knowledge and
    promote safe practices within the construction field. They learn about specializations
    (such as alarm installation), safety measures (like wearing dust masks and tidying
    up), materials commonly used (including low-carbon steel), and the importance
    of following manufacturers instructions. The game aims to reinforce knowledge
    and promote safe practices within the construction field.
